[
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P1-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P1-S1",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Few creations of big technology capture the imagination like giant dams.",
    "translation": "很少有大型科技作品能像巨型水坝那样激发人们的想象力。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_1998.js",
      "year": 1998,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:c71e43039cf4f65c236d585fa7a24008ef7465f8dadb39fdc28a6a7f62f37550"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P1-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P1-S2",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Perhaps it is humankind's long suffering at the mercy of flood and drought that makes the idea of forcing the waters to do our bidding so fascinating.",
    "translation": "也许正是人类长期遭受洪水和干旱的折磨，才使得强迫水域听从我们的命令的想法如此令人着迷。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_1998.js",
      "year": 1998,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:c71e43039cf4f65c236d585fa7a24008ef7465f8dadb39fdc28a6a7f62f37550"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P1-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P1-S3",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "But to be fascinated is also, sometimes, to be blind.",
    "translation": "但有时候，着迷也意味着盲目。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_1998.js",
      "year": 1998,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:c71e43039cf4f65c236d585fa7a24008ef7465f8dadb39fdc28a6a7f62f37550"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P1-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P1-S4",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Several giant dam projects threaten to do more harm than good.",
    "translation": "几个巨型水坝项目可能弊大于利。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_1998.js",
      "year": 1998,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:c71e43039cf4f65c236d585fa7a24008ef7465f8dadb39fdc28a6a7f62f37550"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 5,
      "ps": "P1-S5"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 5,
      "id": "P1-S5",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "The lesson from dams is that big is not always beautiful.",
    "translation": "大坝的教训是，大并不总是美丽的。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_1998.js",
      "year": 1998,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:c71e43039cf4f65c236d585fa7a24008ef7465f8dadb39fdc28a6a7f62f37550"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 6,
      "ps": "P1-S6"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 6,
      "id": "P1-S6",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "It doesn't help that building a big, powerful dam has become a symbol of achievement for nations and people striving to assert themselves.",
    "translation": "建造一座强大的大坝已成为努力维护自己的国家和人民成就的象征，这无济于事。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_1998.js",
      "year": 1998,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:c71e43039cf4f65c236d585fa7a24008ef7465f8dadb39fdc28a6a7f62f37550"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 7,
      "ps": "P1-S7"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 7,
      "id": "P1-S7",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Egypt's leadership in the Arab world was cemented by the Aswan High Dam.",
    "translation": "阿斯旺大坝巩固了埃及在阿拉伯世界的领导地位。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_1998.js",
      "year": 1998,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:c71e43039cf4f65c236d585fa7a24008ef7465f8dadb39fdc28a6a7f62f37550"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P2-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P2-S1",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "Turkey's bid for First World status includes the giant Ataturk Dam.",
    "translation": "土耳其对第一世界地位的争夺包括巨型阿塔图尔克大坝。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_1998.js",
      "year": 1998,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:c71e43039cf4f65c236d585fa7a24008ef7465f8dadb39fdc28a6a7f62f37550"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P2-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P2-S2",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "But big dams tend not to work as intended.",
    "translation": "但大坝往往无法按预期发挥作用。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_1998.js",
      "year": 1998,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:c71e43039cf4f65c236d585fa7a24008ef7465f8dadb39fdc28a6a7f62f37550"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P2-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P2-S3",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "The Aswan Dam, for example, stopped the Nile flooding but deprived Egypt of the fertile silt that floods left—all in return for a giant reservoir of disease which is now so full of silt that it barely generates electricity.",
    "translation": "例如，阿斯旺大坝阻止了尼罗河的洪水，但剥夺了埃及洪水留下的肥沃淤泥——所有这些都换来了一个巨大的疾病库，现在这个库已经充满了淤泥，几乎无法发电。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_1998.js",
      "year": 1998,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:c71e43039cf4f65c236d585fa7a24008ef7465f8dadb39fdc28a6a7f62f37550"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P2-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P2-S4",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "And yet, the myth of controlling the waters persists.",
    "translation": "然而，控制水域的神话依然存在。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_1998.js",
      "year": 1998,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:c71e43039cf4f65c236d585fa7a24008ef7465f8dadb39fdc28a6a7f62f37550"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 5,
      "ps": "P2-S5"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 5,
      "id": "P2-S5",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "This week, in the heart of civilized Europe, Slovaks and Hungarians stopped just short of sending in the troops in their contention over a dam on the Danube.",
    "translation": "本周，在文明欧洲的中心，斯洛伐克人和匈牙利人差点就派出军队来争夺多瑙河上的一座大坝。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_1998.js",
      "year": 1998,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:c71e43039cf4f65c236d585fa7a24008ef7465f8dadb39fdc28a6a7f62f37550"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 6,
      "ps": "P2-S6"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 6,
      "id": "P2-S6",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "The huge complex will probably have all the usual problems of big dams.",
    "translation": "这个巨大的综合体可能会遇到大型水坝的所有常见问题。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_1998.js",
      "year": 1998,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:c71e43039cf4f65c236d585fa7a24008ef7465f8dadb39fdc28a6a7f62f37550"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 7,
      "ps": "P2-S7"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 7,
      "id": "P2-S7",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "But Slovakia is bidding for independence from the Czechs, and now needs a dam to prove itself.",
    "translation": "但斯洛伐克正在争取从捷克独立，现在需要一座大坝来证明自己。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_1998.js",
      "year": 1998,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:c71e43039cf4f65c236d585fa7a24008ef7465f8dadb39fdc28a6a7f62f37550"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P3-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P3-S1",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "Meanwhile, in India, the World Bank has given the go-ahead to the even more wrong-headed Narmada Dam.",
    "translation": "与此同时，在印度，世界银行批准了更加错误的讷尔默达大坝建设。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_1998.js",
      "year": 1998,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:c71e43039cf4f65c236d585fa7a24008ef7465f8dadb39fdc28a6a7f62f37550"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P3-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P3-S2",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "And the bank has done this even though its advisors say the dam will cause hardship for the powerless and environmental destruction.",
    "translation": "尽管该银行的顾问表示，大坝会给弱势群体带来困难，而且还会造成环境破坏，但该银行还是这么做了。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_1998.js",
      "year": 1998,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:c71e43039cf4f65c236d585fa7a24008ef7465f8dadb39fdc28a6a7f62f37550"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P3-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P3-S3",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "The benefits are for the powerful, but they are far from guaranteed.",
    "translation": "强者会得到好处，但远不能保证。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_1998.js",
      "year": 1998,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:c71e43039cf4f65c236d585fa7a24008ef7465f8dadb39fdc28a6a7f62f37550"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P3-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P3-S4",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "Proper, scientific study of the impacts of dams and of the cost and benefits of controlling water can help to resolve these conflicts.",
    "translation": "对水坝的影响以及控制水的成本和效益进行适当的科学研究有助于解决这些冲突。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_1998.js",
      "year": 1998,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:c71e43039cf4f65c236d585fa7a24008ef7465f8dadb39fdc28a6a7f62f37550"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 5,
      "ps": "P3-S5"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 5,
      "id": "P3-S5",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "Hydroelectric power and flood control and irrigation are possible without building monster dams.",
    "translation": "无需建造巨型水坝即可实现水力发电、防洪和灌溉。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_1998.js",
      "year": 1998,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:c71e43039cf4f65c236d585fa7a24008ef7465f8dadb39fdc28a6a7f62f37550"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 6,
      "ps": "P3-S6"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 6,
      "id": "P3-S6",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "But when you are dealing with myths, it is hard to be either proper or scientific.",
    "translation": "但当你处理神话时，很难做到正确或科学。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_1998.js",
      "year": 1998,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:c71e43039cf4f65c236d585fa7a24008ef7465f8dadb39fdc28a6a7f62f37550"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-1998-r-t1",
    "location": {
